#. module: om_whatsapp_event
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_event
msgid ""
"Bridge between Events and the WhatsApp connector of Odoo Mates: the "
"communication schedule of an event, or of an event template, takes WhatsApp "
"templates next to the email ones, to confirm each registration and remind "
"the attendees before the event. Opted-out numbers are skipped, and every "
"message is kept on the registration."
msgstr ""

